    "text": {
     "en": "Adolescents may feel strong emotions, mood swings and a wish for independence. They may also feel stress about studies or friends.\nTo handle it: talk to trusted elders or friends, sleep well, eat healthy food, play and follow hobbies, and avoid harmful habits like smoking or drugs.\nAdolescence can be a joyful stage when we respect ourselves and others and ask questions without fear."
